{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Devil Daggers and Quake, this lightning-fast shooter hurls you into surreal arenas where speed and precision are everything. Merge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through chaos \u2014 alone or together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim your immortality on cross-platform leaderboards. Your name is eternal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vexatious Combat:</strong> Enemies strike from all sides - survive by mastering your movement and aggression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine The Elements:</strong> Assign elemental runes to each hand and fuse them for devastating results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Fire Sessions:</strong> Dive into a rapid-fire campaign of levels that explode with speed, chaos, and pure adrenaline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op &amp; Solo:</strong> Fight alone or with up to two allies. The challenge adapts, so every run is a test of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Leave your mark and fight your way up the global leaderboards, where only the deadliest rise to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional VR Support:</strong> Unleash all six degrees of freedom and compete with players from the Meta Quest Platform.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.poster.avif?t=1769414807\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.webm?t=1769414807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com